qualityObjective.en:
Install underground utility systems in the correct location, elevation and configuration, using approved materials, with proper bedding, joints, protection, identification, testing, backfill and as-built traceability.
Examples may include:
water;
sanitary;
storm;
electrical duct banks;
telecom;
grounding;
fire-protection services;
other site utilities.

Examples:
sidewalks;
pads;
aprons;
ramps;
exterior slabs;
equipment pads;
concrete channels.
Construct exterior concrete at the correct geometry, slope and finish using approved materials, with proper joints, curing and weather protection.
